Changes:

src/types.ts
- BuildingKind now includes "storehouse".

src/sim.ts
- BUILDING_COSTS: added storehouse: { wood: 25, stone: 10 }.
- New BUILDING_PREREQUISITES map: hut/farm/quarry have null; storehouse requires "hut".
- build() now also throws if the prerequisite building hasn't been built yet (e.g. `storehouse requires a hut`), so the new rule is enforced at build time, not just in availability.
- New exported helpers:
  - isAllowed(settlement, kind) — true if no prereq or the prereq is already in settlement.buildings.
  - availableBuildings(settlement) — returns every BuildingKind that passes both canAfford and isAllowed.

